<title>SPAIN: Spain's Repsol ups Astra stake.</title>
<headline>Spain's Repsol ups Astra stake.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish energy group Repsol has increased its stake in Argentine oil firm Astra to 47.5 percent from 37.7 percent, Repsol said on Friday.</p>
<p>The firm subscribed a $90 million (around 12.5 billion pesetas) capital increase in Astra, buying five million shares.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
